How many unique events does this single-threaded in-memory demonstration accept?

```java
var processed = new java.util.HashSet<String>();
int accepted = 0;
for (String eventId : java.util.List.of("e1", "e1", "e2")) {
  if (processed.add(eventId)) accepted++;
}
System.out.println(accepted);
```
